# The pictures of clearance.md: the pin in the plate's bore and the
# hollowed box of examples/scripts/clearance, as the example saves
# them (testdata/solid/clearance.tlspr).
file $testdata/solid/clearance.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot clearance-1-model gw
cursor on
menu Analyze|Clearance and Walls...
twmove 60 145
mark 28 140 110 22 tw
shot clearance-2-screen tw
twdown L 60 145
twup L 60 145
cursor off
shot clearance-3-gaps
cursor on
twmove 267 115
twdown L 267 115
twup L 267 115
edit 1.5
twmove 204 145
twdown L 204 145
twup L 204 145
tw
cursor off
shot clearance-4-walls
